/.quarto/
/_book/
# _freeze/ is COMMITTED on purpose: the deploy workflow renders the book from these
# frozen results, so CI assembles HTML without running Julia (and therefore without
# Python, which the unported chapters would otherwise drag in). Re-ignore it once the
# port is complete and CI can execute chapters itself.
/*/*_files/
/*/*.ipynb/
/*/bonepile.qmd
/*/references.bib
weave_support.jl
**/*.quarto_ipynb
